budgie-backgrounds (4.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release
    - use the upstream jxl tarball to overcome the reproducibility issues
      of using the optimisation tools
    - drop existing patches since the revised package no longer builds
      wallpapers
  * Packaging Changes
    d/control - drop most B/D since we are now just installing precompiled
      files
    d/control - bump StandardsVersion; no additional changes required
    d/watch - update for precompile tarball download location
    d/install - install the tarball files in the standard backgrounds
      locations
    d/copyright - bump copyright years

 -- David Mohammed <fossfreedom@ubuntu.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:30:49 +0000

